each run asserts `T = a_r b3^2 + b_r b3 + c_r`, `G_r = a_0 T_{2t-1-r} - a_r T_{2t-1}`,
and the ELIMINANT certificate `W_r = B_r^2 T_{2t-1} - G_r(a_0 G_r - 2a_0 C_r + b_0 B_r)`
