+To be completed from the charged Abel reduction, including both factors of
+the quadratic coefficient algebra and all repeated-root strata.
+
+## 3. Structural argument
+
+Work in progress. The target is `B W'(0)=0` for every normalized solution
+of (F1)–(F3), for every integer `t>=3` and both `d` with `3d^2=t+1`.
