+# K=16 coefficient-sensitive polynomial Abel equation
+
+Lane: `k16-f3abel-astra-20260905`. Date: 2026-09-05.
+
+Status: WORKING SKELETON. No theorem promotion is made by this skeleton.
+
+## 1. Frozen provenance and operational scope
+
+All ten frozen inputs in `/tmp/jc2-lane.zx9GKm/inputs` passed SHA-256
+verification before mathematical work. The manifest was generated with awk
+from `xmodel/k16-f3abel-astra-20260905.run.v2`, without retyping hash digits,
+and checked with `sha256sum -c`. It is saved at
